<title>POLAND: KROSNO JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.44 MLN.</title>
<headline>KROSNO JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.44 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.44 vs   0.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.75 vs   0.90</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.58 vs   0.98</p>
<p> Sales		   16.39 vs  14.41</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.72 vs   6.76</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.63 vs  10.48</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.21 vs  11.21</p>
<p> Sales		  109.06 vs 105.38</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish glassmaker is Krosnienskie Huty</p>
<p>Szkla Krosno SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
